{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<img alt=\"錫克廟燈飾每晚亮燈至下周二\" src=\"https://news.now.com/nownews/NewsImage/SIKHI-LIGHT-261211-23.jpg\"><p>【Now新聞台】灣仔錫克廟設置大型燈飾維持至下周二，慶祝錫克教的囚徒解放日及印度教的排燈節。</p><p>錫克廟外圍掛起大量燈飾，包圍著整幢建築，吸引不少市民「打卡」，燈飾每晚約6時至10時亮燈直至下周二。</p><p>錫克廟1901興建，是本港最古老的錫克教名寺，2018年拆卸重建，2022年重開，錫克廟對公眾開放，入內參觀時要穿著樸素衣服及遮蓋頭部。</p><p></p></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-12T16:03:55.166193+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":166,"images":1,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-12T15:11:30+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-13T20:20:39.945868+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-12T15:57:27.599606+00:00","content_hash":"70e50cafc2047b1cc380d2e3799e87d4567ecf41445f004c276daead468f5b51","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-12T16:03:55.166193+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}